EXECUTIVE STRATEGIC CHARTER (2026-2028)
Giri Orbit Sovereign Enterprise Architecture
Authored by: Abhinav Giri (github.com/abhinavgiri45)
Contact: abhinavgiri370@gmail.com

1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY & MISSION
The purpose of this charter is to establish total cryptographic sovereignty, eliminate external cloud dependencies, and deliver ultra-responsive native desktop tools that operate 100% in-memory with zero telemetry.

2. CORE PILLARS OF OPERATION
• Complete In-Memory Privacy: All user documents, matrices, and presentation slides are processed exclusively in local RAM.
• Zero Cloud Telemetry: No background pings, no telemetry cookies, and no third-party verification challenges.
• High-Velocity Native C++ Performance: Millisecond startup time, sub-15MB RAM footprint, and instant file input/output.
• Universal Office Compatibility (.giri): Seamless two-way data interchange across Drift, Axis, and Kinetic.

3. GOVERNANCE & ARCHITECTURAL STANDARDS
All subsequent software releases must adhere strictly to sovereign native compilation guidelines using Win32 API, GDI+, and zero web wrappers.

